  m_text: "\nGame Setting Options:\n\n\u2022 To access game settings, click the spanner
    icon in the game panel.\n\n\u2022 Background music. Turn on or off the background
    soundtrack.\n\n\u2022 Sound effects. Turns the game sound effects on or off.\n\n\u2022
    Soundtrack. Choose a game soundtrack.\n\n\u2022 Quick spin. Turns the quick spin
    option on or off. (not offered by all operators).\n\n\u2022 Auto Adjust Bet.
    Turns the Auto Adjust Bet function on or off.\n\n\u2022 Game history. Click to
    view your latest game history.\n\n\nAdvanced Autoplay Options\n\n\u2022 To set
    Advanced Autoplay Options click AUTO in the game panel, and then click Advanced
    settings.\n\n\u2022 On any win. Stops Autoplay when you win in a round.\n\n\u2022
    If single win exceeds. Stops Autoplay when the amount you win exceeds or equals
    the amount you specify.\n\n\u2022 If cash increases by. Stops Autoplay if cash
    increases by the amount you specify.\n\n\u2022 If cash decreases by. Stops Autoplay
    if cash decreases by the amount you specify.\n\n\u2022 Click Reset to clear all
    selected Stop Autoplay options.\n\n\u2022 Note: When changing Autoplay settings
    during a game round, all settings will take effect once the game round or feature
    is completed."
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8f586378b4e144a9851e7b34d9b748ee, type: 2}
